        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "6 Station Road, Kingscourt, Co. Cavan\r\n\r\nA fresh renovation in a central Kingscourt location.\r\n\r\nKeenan Auctioneers present 6 Station Road, a two-bedroom ground-floor apartment newly renovated and finished to a high standard throughout.\r\n\r\nFresh flooring and painting combine with new appliances, doors and windows to give the apartment a clean, modern finish.\r\n\r\nAll accommodation is arranged on ground-floor level, with a generous kitchen and living area, two bedrooms and one bathroom. The layout is simple, practical and easy to live in.\r\n\r\nLocated on Station Road, Kingscourt Main Street, SuperValu, shops, cafés and everyday amenities are all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\n**Key Details**\r\n\r\n* Two bedrooms\r\n* One bathroom\r\n* Ground-floor apartment\r\n* Freshly renovated throughout\r\n* Generous kitchen and living area\r\n* New flooring, appliances, doors and windows\r\n* Central Kingscourt location\r\n\r\nTo apply or request full details, please email [info@keenanauctioneers.com](mailto:info@keenanauctioneers.com) with landlord and s, photo ID, contact number, and details of intended occupants."
      }
